# Cloudflare Pages response headers (plans/demo-readiness.md §2.5).
#
# JavaScript and CSS are served at unchanging URLs, and Cloudflare's default
# lets a browser keep them for four hours without asking, while index.html is
# always fresh. After a deploy, a returning player got the new page with the
# old code and styles. max-age=0 with must-revalidate makes the browser ask on
# every load; the ETags Cloudflare already sends make an unchanged file a 304,
# not a download.

/*.js
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate

/*.css
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=0, must-revalidate
